# Optional: dedicated key entries that can ONLY control the camera.
# Replace each ssh-ed25519 public key with a key generated for that device.
# These entries deliberately have no shell, no forwarding, no agent access,
# no X11, and no PTY.
#
# Example:
# command="/usr/local/sbin/security-cam-ssh-control",restrict ssh-ed25519 AAAA... camera-phone
# command="/usr/local/sbin/security-cam-ssh-control",restrict ssh-ed25519 AAAA... camera-desktop
# command="/usr/local/sbin/security-cam-ssh-control",restrict ssh-ed25519 AAAA... camera-laptop
